WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.446 --> 00:00:15.487
Tommy was up early the next morning.

2
00:00:15.988 --> 00:00:19.630
He did his chores quickly and then headed for the doctor's house.

3
00:00:20.530 --> 00:00:22.831
When he arrived, the house seemed empty.

4
00:00:22.851 --> 00:00:26.713
"I hope it's not too early," Tommy said to himself.

5
00:00:26.734 --> 00:00:29.655
"Hello? Dr.

6
00:00:31.536 --> 00:00:34.358
Dolittle?" Tommy called out, but there was no reply.

7
00:00:35.059 --> 00:00:37.320
Tommy took a few more steps inside.

8
00:00:38.001 --> 00:00:40.642
Suddenly he heard a low, growling noise.

9
00:00:42.043 --> 00:00:46.186
Tommy was about to turn around and leave when he heard a familiar voice.

10
00:00:46.206 --> 00:00:48.568
"Jip! Stop that!

11
00:00:49.048 --> 00:00:50.009
You know Tommy!"

12
00:00:50.689 --> 00:00:55.833
Dr. Dolittle came running out, wearing a funny pair of glasses and rubber gloves.

13
00:00:55.853 --> 00:00:58.215
"Good morning, Tommy!"

14
00:00:58.595 --> 00:00:59.816
The doctor smiled.

15
00:01:01.028 --> 00:01:04.131
"I was trying to speak with the wiff-waff," said the doctor.

16
00:01:04.151 --> 00:01:06.493
"Have you made progress?"

17
00:01:06.994 --> 00:01:08.175
Tommy asked politely.

18
00:01:08.195 --> 00:01:11.417
"No, not really," sighed the doctor.

19
00:01:12.118 --> 00:01:13.319
Tommy patted Jip.

20
00:01:14.120 --> 00:01:16.002
"Where are Polynesia and the others?"

21
00:01:16.402 --> 00:01:16.882
he asked.

22
00:01:16.902 --> 00:01:20.145
"Out in the garden for their morning walk."

23
00:01:20.165 --> 00:01:22.708
Dr. Dolittle removed his funny glasses.

24
00:01:22.728 --> 00:01:25.190
"Would you like to see my garden?"

25
00:01:26.091 --> 00:01:27.372
Tommy did indeed.

26
00:01:28.368 --> 00:01:31.289
Dr. Dolittle led Tommy through a thick forest.

27
00:01:31.870 --> 00:01:36.732
He heard all kinds of animal sounds but could not see anything except trees.

28
00:01:37.492 --> 00:01:40.373
Then suddenly, Tommy stopped in his tracks.

29
00:01:41.074 --> 00:01:43.375
The forest opened into a large field.

30
00:01:44.275 --> 00:01:49.077
The field was full of all sorts of flowers, animals, birds, and insects.

31
00:01:52.119 --> 00:01:55.200
It was the most beautiful sight Tommy had ever seen.

32
00:01:56.192 --> 00:01:58.894
Tommy spotted Gub-Gub rolling around in mud.

33
00:01:59.634 --> 00:02:02.596
He saw Dab-Dab diving in and out of a pond.

34
00:02:03.316 --> 00:02:08.759
And sitting on a large tree branch, Polynesia was chatting to another colorful bird.

35
00:02:10.800 --> 00:02:12.801
Suddenly Tommy let out a scream.

36
00:02:14.082 --> 00:02:17.804
A large black snake was sliding over his foot.

37
00:02:18.344 --> 00:02:19.005
He jumped.

38
00:02:19.025 --> 00:02:23.287
"Well, I told him to move his foot, didn't I?"

39
00:02:23.687 --> 00:02:24.908
hissed the reptile.

40
00:02:25.768 --> 00:02:26.769
"That's Stanley.

41
00:02:27.089 --> 00:02:29.610
Don't worry, he's harmless," Dr.

42
00:02:29.650 --> 00:02:31.011
Dolittle said, smiling.

43
00:02:31.031 --> 00:02:34.793
"Do you have any lions or tigers?"

44
00:02:35.413 --> 00:02:36.074
asked Tommy.

45
00:02:36.094 --> 00:02:41.897
"I'd like to, but they would eat up all the other animals," the doctor said sadly.

46
00:02:41.917 --> 00:02:44.198
"Oh, you have a deer!"

47
00:02:44.699 --> 00:02:46.199
Tommy pointed excitedly.

48
00:02:46.219 --> 00:02:50.382
"No, that's not a deer," the doctor said.

49
00:02:52.303 --> 00:02:54.304
Tommy could not believe his eyes!

50
00:02:54.844 --> 00:02:56.686
The creature had two heads.

51
00:02:57.366 --> 00:02:59.928
"Look at him staring," said one head.

52
00:02:59.948 --> 00:03:01.669
"How rude!"

53
00:03:02.209 --> 00:03:03.330
remarked the other head.

54
00:03:03.350 --> 00:03:08.294
"It's his first time seeing you, that's all," the doctor said kindly.

55
00:03:08.314 --> 00:03:12.937
"Come here, Tommy," the doctor called out.

56
00:03:12.957 --> 00:03:15.959
"This is the rarest animal in the world.

57
00:03:16.740 --> 00:03:19.022
It's the pushmi-pullyu, from Africa."

58
00:03:19.922 --> 00:03:21.944
Tommy walked over to it nervously.

59
00:03:23.448 --> 00:03:25.088
"Can I get back to my breakfast, Doctor?"

60
00:03:25.649 --> 00:03:26.769
said the pushmi head.

61
00:03:26.789 --> 00:03:28.089
"I'm so hungry."

62
00:03:28.869 --> 00:03:30.710
Tommy gently touched the creature.

63
00:03:30.730 --> 00:03:35.491
"Well, at least he doesn't scratch," said the pullyu head.

64
00:03:36.732 --> 00:03:38.072
Tommy was amazed.

65
00:03:38.092 --> 00:03:41.593
"It's a wonderful garden, Doctor," he said.

66
00:03:41.613 --> 00:03:44.034
"But it's a lot of work."

67
00:03:44.474 --> 00:03:45.554
The doctor sighed.

68
00:03:45.574 --> 00:03:48.835
"I could use some help to look after all the animals."

69
00:03:49.435 --> 00:03:50.755
Tommy's heart leaped.

70
00:03:51.396 --> 00:03:53.096
"I could help you, Dr.

71
00:03:53.116 --> 00:03:54.416
Dolittle," he said excitedly.

72
00:03:54.436 --> 00:03:59.538
"Yes, I do need an assistant," the doctor replied thoughtfully.

73
00:03:59.558 --> 00:04:05.539
"I'm a hard worker and I do love animals," Tommy said eagerly.

74
00:04:06.340 --> 00:04:07.760
The doctor rubbed his chin.

75
00:04:07.780 --> 00:04:12.221
"I think it's a great idea," Polynesia said.

76
00:04:13.122 --> 00:04:15.122
Tommy looked at the doctor hopefully.

77
00:04:15.142 --> 00:04:16.983
"All right, Tommy.

78
00:04:17.323 --> 00:04:21.404
If your parents agree, you can be my assistant," smiled the doctor.

79
00:04:22.516 --> 00:04:28.182
Tommy let out such a loud shout of joy that all the animals stopped and stared.

80
00:04:29.423 --> 00:04:35.389
"Humans are so strange," remarked the pushmi-pullyu to itself.

81
00:04:36.350 --> 00:04:37.932
"And they say we're loud!"

82
00:04:38.573 --> 00:04:38.893
quacked
